   *
   * This operation directly modifies the shopping_mall_reviews table and
   * triggers the snapshot system to preserve the previous version of the review
   * for compliance and dispute resolution purposes. Related operations include
   * creating a new review (POST /products/{productId}/reviews) and reading
   * review details (GET /products/{productId}/reviews).
   *
   * @param connection
