   * This operation allows customers to request cancellation of order items
   * before shipment. The cancellation request must include a reason (minimum 10
   * characters) explaining why the item should be cancelled. The request is
   * then queued for review by the seller, who may approve or reject the
   * cancellation within 48 hours.
