   * This dashboard endpoint provides a high-level overview of review activity,
   * based on the immutable snapshot policy defined in
   * 13-reviews-and-ratings.md. It calculates and returns summaries of review
   * volume, average rating, and review status distribution (active vs
   * user-deleted vs admin-deleted), enabling administrators and seller managers
   * to monitor content integrity and customer feedback trends without exposing
   * individual review content.
   *
   * The system aggregates data from the Reviews table, respecting the rules for
   * dynamic rating calculation: user-deleted reviews retain their numeric
   * rating in the average, while admin-deleted reviews are fully excluded from
   * all calculations. Snapshots preserve all edits and deletions as historical
   * records accessible only to authorized actors per the Snapshot Principle.
   *
   * This endpoint does not return individual reviews — it returns only summary
   * aggregates to protect privacy and ensure compliance with data retention
   * policies.
   *
   * Security note: This endpoint is authorized only for admin and seller roles.
   * Customers do not have access to this aggregation endpoint. Cache policy
   * enforces 1-minute TTL to enable real-time updates under load, as reviews
   * can be edited or deleted dynamically.
