   * aggregating data from the shopping_mall_reviews table. This operation
   * calculates key performance indicators including average rating, total
   * review count, and rating distribution across the entire product catalog or
   * specific product categories.
   *
   * The system computes these metrics dynamically by aggregating non-deleted
   * reviews. Ratings from customer-deleted reviews are still included in
   * average calculations according to the business requirements in
   * 13-reviews-and-ratings.md, while admin-deleted reviews are excluded from
